WEBVTT

00:00:00.510 --> 00:00:03.590
ano toki umareta no

00:00:00.510 --> 00:00:03.590
あのとき生まれたの

00:00:00.510 --> 00:00:03.590
I'll softly give you my thoughts

00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:09.120
watashi no omoi sotto ageru

00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:09.120
私の想いそっとあげる

00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:09.120
That were born at that moment

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:15.010
shinjite ite

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:15.010
信じていて

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:15.010
Please believe in them

00:00:25.930 --> 00:00:28.450
deatta hi kara

00:00:25.930 --> 00:00:28.450
出逢った日から

00:00:25.930 --> 00:00:28.450
Since the day when we met

00:00:28.450 --> 00:00:32.710
hajimete no kimochi megutteru

00:00:28.450 --> 00:00:32.710
初めての気持ち巡ってる

00:00:28.450 --> 00:00:32.710
For the first time, I have these feelings, and they go around

00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:37.740
honto no egao hoshii nante

00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:37.740
ホントの笑顔ほしいなんて

00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:37.740
I want your true smile

00:00:37.890 --> 00:00:42.620
anata ga oshiete kureta sorao

00:00:37.890 --> 00:00:42.620
あなたが教えてくれた空を

00:00:37.890 --> 00:00:42.620
I embrace the sky

00:00:42.790 --> 00:00:47.740
dakishimete yume o miru

00:00:42.790 --> 00:00:47.740
抱きしめて夢をみる

00:00:42.790 --> 00:00:47.740
That you told me about and dream

00:00:47.980 --> 00:00:49.590
tooi keredo・・・

00:00:47.980 --> 00:00:49.590
遠いけれど・・・

00:00:47.980 --> 00:00:49.590
It's faraway, but...

00:00:50.010 --> 00:00:54.800
atatakai hikari no kakera

00:00:50.010 --> 00:00:54.800
あたたかい光のかけら

00:00:50.010 --> 00:00:54.800
The fragments of warm light

00:00:54.970 --> 00:01:00.600
kizutsuita hane ni inochi o kureta no

00:00:54.970 --> 00:01:00.600
傷ついた羽根に命をくれたの

00:00:54.970 --> 00:01:00.600
Gave life to my wounded wings

00:01:00.910 --> 00:01:04.010
fureta toki umareta

00:01:00.910 --> 00:01:04.010
触れたとき生まれた

00:01:00.910 --> 00:01:04.010
Born at the moment when we touched

00:01:04.150 --> 00:01:08.090
tsuyoi watashi no soba ni

00:01:04.150 --> 00:01:08.090
強い私のそばに

00:01:04.150 --> 00:01:08.090
Next to me, who is strong

00:01:08.260 --> 00:01:13.290
mamoraretai watashi ga nemutte ita no

00:01:08.260 --> 00:01:13.290
守られたいわたしが眠っていたの

00:01:08.260 --> 00:01:13.290
The me who wants to be protected was asleep

00:01:13.470 --> 00:01:18.310
sou unmei kaerareru ne

00:01:13.470 --> 00:01:18.310
そう運命変えられるね

00:01:13.470 --> 00:01:18.310
That's right, destiny can be changed

00:01:18.530 --> 00:01:26.370
futari no koi mezamesasete・・・

00:01:18.530 --> 00:01:26.370
ふたりの恋目覚めさせて・・・

00:01:18.530 --> 00:01:26.370
Let our love awaken...

00:01:29.900 --> 00:01:29.940
{last frame of OP}

00:01:31.510 --> 00:01:34.240
Oh? Isn't this plate for the han families?

00:01:31.510 --> 00:01:34.240
Note: The han families are one of the lowest ranked in the Japanese imperial court.

00:01:34.240 --> 00:01:35.790
Is it not to your liking?

00:01:35.790 --> 00:01:40.120
No, it's fine. This plate is quite adequate for me.

00:01:40.990 --> 00:01:42.340
Regarding Murasaki...

00:01:42.880 --> 00:01:46.090
I heard it was a woman named Benika who kidnapped her.

00:01:46.600 --> 00:01:47.550
Who did you hear that from?

00:01:48.140 --> 00:01:51.350
Is knowledge of the source really that important?

00:01:51.350 --> 00:01:52.180
No.

00:01:52.180 --> 00:01:55.230
Things will come your way whether you choose to leave them alone or not.

00:01:55.230 --> 00:01:57.310
But whether or not that information is the truth...

00:01:57.760 --> 00:01:58.480
Is it not?

00:01:58.750 --> 00:02:02.840
Whether it is fact or not, there are no problems.

00:02:03.630 --> 00:02:06.320
Will Murasaki ever return to the Inner Sanctuary?

00:02:06.840 --> 00:02:11.210
"Things will come your way whether you choose to leave them alone or not," isn't that right?

00:02:12.180 --> 00:02:13.990
Perhaps...

00:02:13.990 --> 00:02:15.750
You may be right.

00:02:35.760 --> 00:02:36.910
Mom...

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:39.390
Dad...

00:02:45.630 --> 00:02:46.940
Mo-

00:02:47.580 --> 00:02:48.820
Mom?

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:08.160
Second Episode 「With the Drain and Stream」

00:03:09.720 --> 00:03:11.000
Shinkurou.

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:13.470
Were you having a nightmare last night?

00:03:14.080 --> 00:03:15.030
Was I?

00:03:16.220 --> 00:03:17.790
That's probably because my snoring was loud.

00:03:17.790 --> 00:03:19.610
That was <i>snoring</i>?

00:03:20.390 --> 00:03:23.620
In any case, are you sure I can go to school?

00:03:23.620 --> 00:03:25.440
Can you really stay home by yourself?

00:03:25.440 --> 00:03:26.890
Don't treat me like a fool.

00:03:26.890 --> 00:03:30.150
Benika said this place would be safe, didn't she?

00:03:30.150 --> 00:03:32.090
Anyway, just don't go outside.

00:03:32.090 --> 00:03:32.950
Of course.

00:03:32.950 --> 00:03:35.070
If anything happens, call me on my cellphone.

00:03:35.320 --> 00:03:37.050
No problem.

00:03:37.050 --> 00:03:40.400
Got it? Make sure you don't leave Samidare Apartment by yourself.

00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:41.740
I heard you earlier.

00:03:41.740 --> 00:03:43.420
You should stay in this room unless you need to use the toilet.

00:03:43.710 --> 00:03:44.750
And if someone comes-

00:03:48.190 --> 00:03:49.620
Shinkurou?

00:03:49.620 --> 00:03:50.420
What?

00:03:51.130 --> 00:03:53.430
Shouldn't you be going to school?

00:03:59.320 --> 00:04:00.080
It's bright.

00:04:00.080 --> 00:04:02.560
Hey, will I really get to see you tonight?

00:04:02.560 --> 00:04:06.020
I see. She's just being considerate in her own way.

00:04:06.020 --> 00:04:07.210
Will it be all right?

00:04:07.210 --> 00:04:08.120
You mean school?

00:04:08.120 --> 00:04:09.070
That's not it.

00:04:09.820 --> 00:04:13.780
I know. But, he'll get used to it soon enough.

00:04:15.060 --> 00:04:17.780
My husband's meetings have been ending late and I just thought it was so.

00:04:17.780 --> 00:04:20.440
You see, the part where you doubt-

00:04:20.440 --> 00:04:21.700
It's a cat!

00:04:21.700 --> 00:04:24.830
You may eventually take extreme measures.

00:04:34.170 --> 00:04:35.600
Hello? I-

00:04:35.600 --> 00:04:36.590
Food!

00:04:36.590 --> 00:04:37.090
What?

00:04:37.090 --> 00:04:38.690
Food, I said!

00:04:38.690 --> 00:04:40.090
I told you there's food in the fridge.

00:04:40.090 --> 00:04:42.040
What do cats eat?

00:04:42.040 --> 00:04:42.520
Cats?

00:04:42.520 --> 00:04:45.210
There's one right outside the window!

00:04:45.210 --> 00:04:46.630
No, don't let it in the room!

00:04:46.630 --> 00:04:47.850
Where are the snacks?

00:04:47.850 --> 00:04:48.630
In the lower kitchen.

00:04:48.630 --> 00:04:49.580
Got it!

00:04:50.140 --> 00:04:51.770
Hello? Hel-

00:04:53.110 --> 00:04:54.280
Geez...

00:04:55.160 --> 00:04:58.240
Here, come on!

00:04:58.240 --> 00:05:01.250
Try and eat it, come on!

00:05:10.540 --> 00:05:11.400
Morning.

00:05:11.400 --> 00:05:12.380
Oh, how rare.

00:05:12.380 --> 00:05:13.760
You're usually early.

00:05:14.510 --> 00:05:17.260
Just how am I supposed to eat this?

00:05:18.320 --> 00:05:20.510
Hey, you were late this morning, weren't you?

00:05:21.130 --> 00:05:22.090
Yeah.

00:05:22.090 --> 00:05:25.060
I was preoccupied with my job, so... I didn't sleep much.

00:05:25.060 --> 00:05:28.900
You're the one who said you could keep a job <i>and</i> go to school, right?

00:05:28.900 --> 00:05:30.940
Oh, yeah...

00:05:30.940 --> 00:05:32.980
About the Kuhouin matter.

00:05:32.980 --> 00:05:33.820
Yeah.

00:05:33.820 --> 00:05:36.190
It might not be the right job for you.

00:05:36.190 --> 00:05:38.030
Are the Kuhouins that big?

00:05:38.030 --> 00:05:39.940
So you really don't know anything?

00:05:39.940 --> 00:05:44.570
Well, I suppose the blame falls on Juuzawa Benika rather than you, as she was the one who hired you.

00:05:44.570 --> 00:05:47.210
So, that just shows how much she trusts me.

00:05:47.500 --> 00:05:48.790
She's probably lacking workers.

00:05:49.300 --> 00:05:50.540
You think so?

00:05:51.140 --> 00:05:53.690
It means there's a way to use idiots.

00:05:55.260 --> 00:05:56.000
Sorry.

00:05:58.240 --> 00:06:01.350
You always try to exceed your limitations and end up failing.

00:06:01.960 --> 00:06:04.830
Hey, there's a bag beside the fridge, right?

00:06:04.830 --> 00:06:05.690
Bag?

00:06:05.690 --> 00:06:07.130
A white one from a convenience store.

00:06:07.130 --> 00:06:08.630
What's a convenience store?

00:06:10.360 --> 00:06:11.770
It's a white plastic bag.

00:06:12.330 --> 00:06:13.520
Found it.

00:06:13.520 --> 00:06:15.830
There's bread inside, so you can eat that for now.

00:06:15.830 --> 00:06:18.170
I don't really like bread.

00:06:18.170 --> 00:06:19.150
I see.

00:06:19.150 --> 00:06:22.200
Don't call me over such trivial things.

00:06:25.980 --> 00:06:26.670
Hello?

00:06:26.670 --> 00:06:28.670
There is juice and tea inside, though.

00:06:28.670 --> 00:06:29.370
Yeah, there is.

00:06:29.370 --> 00:06:31.540
May I drink the juice for my meal?

00:06:31.540 --> 00:06:33.320
Sure, do as you please.

00:06:33.720 --> 00:06:34.710
Who's that?

00:06:35.500 --> 00:06:37.490
Are you taking care of someone's meals?

00:06:37.490 --> 00:06:39.680
It's about my job.

00:06:40.140 --> 00:06:42.180
There's this really troublesome old man.

00:06:43.430 --> 00:06:45.890
Open up!

00:06:47.480 --> 00:06:50.510
I wonder if she's eaten yet.

00:06:51.630 --> 00:06:53.410
Wait a bit, Shinkurou!

00:06:57.830 --> 00:06:59.360
Shinkurou-san.

00:06:59.880 --> 00:07:00.820
Yes?

00:07:01.420 --> 00:07:03.120
Having bread again?

00:07:05.140 --> 00:07:07.750
Why couldn't he wait a bit longer?

00:07:08.280 --> 00:07:12.360
You won't have a balanced nutrition if you keep having meals like that.

00:07:12.690 --> 00:07:14.000
It's appetizing, though.

00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:15.210
That's not what I meant.

00:07:16.080 --> 00:07:17.670
Thank you for the meal.

00:07:18.100 --> 00:07:19.380
Mama!

00:07:19.380 --> 00:07:21.870
Miki was able to go shopping on my own!

00:07:21.870 --> 00:07:23.090
"On my own!"

00:07:27.270 --> 00:07:28.530
Man, I'm beat.

00:07:28.530 --> 00:07:30.770
It's tough having gym in the morning, huh?

00:07:31.010 --> 00:07:32.210
We have it tomorrow too.

00:07:32.210 --> 00:07:32.890
Really?

00:07:35.140 --> 00:07:36.080
Toilet, toilet.

00:07:40.460 --> 00:07:41.460
Someone suspicious!

00:07:41.460 --> 00:07:42.600
Who's suspicious?

00:07:42.600 --> 00:07:43.600
You are!

00:07:43.600 --> 00:07:44.880
That's quite the greeting.

00:07:44.880 --> 00:07:46.580
Let go!

00:07:46.580 --> 00:07:47.920
Are you sure you want me to let go?

00:07:47.920 --> 00:07:50.620
Just let go!

00:07:53.870 --> 00:07:55.880
That's why I asked you if it was okay.

00:07:56.770 --> 00:07:58.640
Are you okay, little girl?

00:07:58.640 --> 00:08:00.760
This is nothing.

00:08:01.440 --> 00:08:02.530
I see.

00:08:02.850 --> 00:08:05.090
I'm Yamie from room 4.

00:08:07.340 --> 00:08:08.680
Toilet, toilet, toilet!

00:08:09.710 --> 00:08:12.000
Hey, what's wrong?

00:08:13.410 --> 00:08:14.600
Come on...

00:08:15.230 --> 00:08:18.470
Black clothes and a black cat; are you a witch?

00:08:18.470 --> 00:08:21.150
No, I'm a wicked woman.

00:08:21.150 --> 00:08:22.250
Wicked woman?

00:08:22.250 --> 00:08:25.620
I lead men on, have them support me financially and live in luxury.

00:08:26.240 --> 00:08:28.330
That's a wicked woman.

00:08:30.870 --> 00:08:33.140
Give me a break...

00:08:33.140 --> 00:08:35.160
Hey, we're going to be late.

00:08:35.160 --> 00:08:36.070
Okay.

00:08:36.070 --> 00:08:37.420
Calling your girlfriend?

00:08:37.420 --> 00:08:38.450
No, that's not it.

00:08:38.450 --> 00:08:39.180
The one from the newspaper club?

00:08:39.180 --> 00:08:40.320
I don't think so.

00:08:40.320 --> 00:08:41.630
I said that's not it!

00:08:41.950 --> 00:08:44.130
From room 6, I'm Mutou Tamaki.

00:08:44.130 --> 00:08:46.190
I'm Shinkurou-kun's woman.

00:08:46.190 --> 00:08:48.470
I can see that you're a woman.

00:08:48.470 --> 00:08:50.600
Hey, hey, how old are you, Murasaki-chan?

00:08:50.940 --> 00:08:52.100
Seven years old.

00:08:52.470 --> 00:08:53.610
You're so soft!

00:08:53.610 --> 00:08:54.600
Don't touch me.

00:08:54.980 --> 00:08:57.150
What kind of relationship do you have with the boy?

00:08:57.460 --> 00:08:59.710
Shinkurou is my servant.

00:09:01.260 --> 00:09:05.500
So, that means you're Shinkurou-kun's master?

00:09:05.500 --> 00:09:07.070
Yes, that's how it is.

00:09:08.400 --> 00:09:09.630
Geez...

00:09:12.160 --> 00:09:14.890
Oh? Is that a new cellphone?

00:09:14.890 --> 00:09:16.410
Yes.

00:09:16.410 --> 00:09:17.630
My previous one broke.

00:09:17.630 --> 00:09:19.570
It's a pretty color.

00:09:19.570 --> 00:09:22.690
I know, these beads here!

00:09:22.690 --> 00:09:23.440
Yeah?

00:09:23.440 --> 00:09:27.180
It's rather difficult to make them circular like this.

00:09:27.550 --> 00:09:29.180
Did you make it yourself?

00:09:29.180 --> 00:09:30.160
I bought it!

00:09:33.290 --> 00:09:35.520
It's really useful since there's a ball pen inside too.

00:09:36.450 --> 00:09:40.480
See? The colors match your cellphone perfectly.

00:09:40.480 --> 00:09:41.510
You're right.

00:09:41.510 --> 00:09:43.730
I'm glad I bought this.

00:09:45.040 --> 00:09:46.130
Come on over here.

00:09:48.550 --> 00:09:49.890
There, there.

00:09:49.890 --> 00:09:52.540
Is your master kind?

00:09:53.520 --> 00:09:56.040
I see, not that bad, huh?

00:09:56.820 --> 00:09:59.560
Isn't the strap too thick?

00:09:59.560 --> 00:10:01.350
It's all right.

00:10:01.350 --> 00:10:02.570
You don't need to put it on.

00:10:02.570 --> 00:10:04.510
I said it's fine.

00:10:04.510 --> 00:10:05.760
Thanks.

00:10:06.470 --> 00:10:10.320
You haven't been coming over lately.

00:10:10.320 --> 00:10:12.660
Are you <i>that</i> busy with your job?

00:10:13.360 --> 00:10:15.140
No, that's not really it.

00:10:16.890 --> 00:10:19.930
About that movie you said you wanted to see last time...

00:10:19.930 --> 00:10:23.830
You won't talk to me about your job, huh?

00:10:23.830 --> 00:10:25.620
It's not that!

00:10:25.620 --> 00:10:28.170
I just want to be able to forget about it when I'm with you.

00:10:29.380 --> 00:10:32.030
After all, I want to talk about fun things.

00:10:33.530 --> 00:10:36.290
And so, that's why you wanted to talk about the movie?

00:10:36.290 --> 00:10:37.450
That's right!

00:10:37.450 --> 00:10:39.380
Thank goodness.

00:10:39.380 --> 00:10:45.550
You're always uneasy, so I was worried that you were doing some dangerous job.

00:10:51.710 --> 00:10:53.200
Hello? Murasaki?

00:10:53.200 --> 00:10:54.840
I have no tobacco.

00:10:58.110 --> 00:10:58.730
Who's this?

00:10:59.230 --> 00:11:01.770
Tobacco... Tobacco...

00:11:01.770 --> 00:11:04.860
Yamie-san? Are you in my room right now?

00:11:04.860 --> 00:11:06.530
Is there a little girl there as well?

00:11:06.530 --> 00:11:07.510
Little girl?

00:11:07.990 --> 00:11:10.270
There's a girl watching my room there, right?

00:11:10.270 --> 00:11:13.650
I'm not sure, I don't even know whose cellphone this is.

00:11:13.650 --> 00:11:15.220
It's mine.

00:11:15.220 --> 00:11:16.950
Is there a girl there or not?

00:11:16.950 --> 00:11:17.820
There was.

00:11:17.820 --> 00:11:18.770
Was?

00:11:18.770 --> 00:11:20.110
She's not here now.

00:11:20.110 --> 00:11:22.110
Not there? Where'd she go?

00:11:22.110 --> 00:11:23.170
Who knows?

00:11:25.190 --> 00:11:27.230
Are you up for buying me some tobacco?

00:11:27.230 --> 00:11:28.720
Of course not!

00:11:29.400 --> 00:11:31.350
Anyway, is she honestly not there?

00:11:31.350 --> 00:11:33.240
Now that you mention it, Davide isn't here either.

00:11:33.240 --> 00:11:34.980
Davide, Davide-

00:11:36.120 --> 00:11:37.180
This is bad.

00:11:38.940 --> 00:11:40.500
This is seriously bad.

00:11:41.570 --> 00:11:42.860
Hello? Tamaki-san?

00:11:41.570 --> 00:11:43.660
The number you have dialed cannot be reached

00:11:43.660 --> 00:11:46.200
due to the owner's circumstances.

00:11:46.200 --> 00:11:47.260
Are you serious?

00:11:52.250 --> 00:11:53.240
Murasaki?

00:11:53.240 --> 00:11:55.320
You're home early, Shinkurou.

00:11:56.320 --> 00:11:57.040
You...

00:11:57.560 --> 00:11:58.870
What are you doing?

00:11:58.870 --> 00:12:00.050
There's no hot water coming out.

00:12:00.610 --> 00:12:02.470
Hot water isn't going to come out.

00:12:02.470 --> 00:12:04.080
And it's getting colder too.

00:12:04.580 --> 00:12:05.800
Where's your phone?

00:12:05.800 --> 00:12:06.850
In front of the TV.

00:12:07.990 --> 00:12:09.450
I called you a few times.

00:12:09.450 --> 00:12:10.720
I did as well.

00:12:11.290 --> 00:12:12.890
You should at least look at the call history.

00:12:12.890 --> 00:12:14.510
What's that?

00:12:15.310 --> 00:12:16.610
This is cold.

00:12:17.630 --> 00:12:19.010
Were you in this room the whole time?

00:12:19.270 --> 00:12:22.070
Boil some water, Shinkurou, this is too cold!

00:12:23.220 --> 00:12:24.560
I want to clean my body.

00:12:24.560 --> 00:12:26.730
It's all sticky and it feels gross.

00:12:26.730 --> 00:12:27.770
I see.

00:12:28.420 --> 00:12:30.480
You've been like that since yesterday.

00:12:30.740 --> 00:12:32.130
I'm unclean.

00:12:32.770 --> 00:12:33.610
Want to go take a bath?

00:12:34.150 --> 00:12:35.320
There's a bath?

00:12:36.360 --> 00:12:37.280
Don't jump!

00:12:37.280 --> 00:12:38.580
Hurry, hurry up!

00:12:42.320 --> 00:12:42.920
Hello.

00:12:42.920 --> 00:12:44.330
Shin-chan.

00:12:44.330 --> 00:12:47.100
She's seven years old, so may she accompany me to the men's bath?

00:12:47.100 --> 00:12:49.000
Sure thing. You had a sister?

00:12:49.480 --> 00:12:51.350
No, I'm taking care of my cousin.

00:12:52.180 --> 00:12:53.920
She's cute.

00:12:54.610 --> 00:12:57.260
So you're into girls like that, Shin-chan...

00:12:57.260 --> 00:12:58.520
No, she's my cousin.

00:12:58.890 --> 00:13:00.640
I see, I see! I was just surprised.

00:13:02.240 --> 00:13:04.230
That kind of misunderstanding is dangerous.

00:13:05.740 --> 00:13:06.980
It's spacious!

00:13:07.430 --> 00:13:08.450
Hey, you'll slip!

00:13:08.450 --> 00:13:09.480
Hurry and come!

00:13:10.670 --> 00:13:11.980
She's quite outgoing.

00:13:13.140 --> 00:13:14.300
It's itchy on the right.

00:13:14.760 --> 00:13:15.700
Here?

00:13:15.700 --> 00:13:16.930
A little lower.

00:13:16.930 --> 00:13:18.200
Okay, okay.

00:13:18.200 --> 00:13:20.000
You sound like you can't stand it.

00:13:20.000 --> 00:13:20.960
Not really.

00:13:20.960 --> 00:13:23.940
My servants did this for me at home.

00:13:23.940 --> 00:13:25.430
This isn't your home, though.

00:13:25.430 --> 00:13:26.830
Shinkurou!

00:13:26.830 --> 00:13:27.310
What?

00:13:27.310 --> 00:13:28.540
Why is it?

00:13:28.540 --> 00:13:33.210
My eyes hurt! It stings, it stings!

00:13:31.100 --> 00:13:32.780
It's because you opened your eyes.

00:13:33.210 --> 00:13:34.450
Okay, let's rinse it off.

00:13:34.450 --> 00:13:35.800
It's cold!

00:13:35.800 --> 00:13:37.510
It's hot, it's hot!

00:13:37.510 --> 00:13:38.110
Hey, are you okay?

00:13:38.110 --> 00:13:39.400
My eyes hurt!

00:13:39.400 --> 00:13:40.910
I said I'll rinse it off!

00:13:40.910 --> 00:13:42.790
It's hot! It's hot!

00:13:42.790 --> 00:13:43.450
Don't be so noisy.

00:13:43.450 --> 00:13:44.330
It hurts!

00:13:44.330 --> 00:13:45.500
It's not hot! Come on.

00:13:45.500 --> 00:13:47.270
Hey, it's hot! My eyes!

00:13:48.650 --> 00:13:50.150
Stop that.

00:13:50.750 --> 00:13:52.460
How much longer?

00:13:52.460 --> 00:13:53.700
2 minutes and 30 seconds.

00:13:53.700 --> 00:13:55.490
I can't stand it anymore.

00:13:55.490 --> 00:13:56.120
No.

00:13:56.120 --> 00:13:57.030
It's bad for my body.

00:13:57.030 --> 00:13:57.740
That's not true.

00:13:57.960 --> 00:13:59.250
Who said that?

00:13:59.250 --> 00:14:00.280
The old lady at the desk.

00:14:00.900 --> 00:14:01.750
Hey.

00:14:01.750 --> 00:14:03.790
No, it's too hot and I'm at my limit!

00:14:04.040 --> 00:14:05.630
That's what's great, though.

00:14:08.680 --> 00:14:09.710
Have you dried off your body properly?

00:14:10.220 --> 00:14:11.040
I did.

00:14:11.330 --> 00:14:12.250
Dry your hair too.

00:14:12.250 --> 00:14:15.010
I know that, you're so annoying.

00:14:15.010 --> 00:14:16.330
Okay, okay.

00:14:19.330 --> 00:14:20.620
Is something wrong?

00:14:20.620 --> 00:14:22.600
Are things going well with Murasaki?

00:14:22.600 --> 00:14:23.490
Yes.

00:14:24.010 --> 00:14:26.100
But, how long do I have to keep this up?

00:14:26.100 --> 00:14:27.230
It hasn't been decided.

00:14:28.000 --> 00:14:30.030
Who is she being targeted by?

00:14:30.030 --> 00:14:30.980
I can't say yet.

00:14:31.600 --> 00:14:34.010
Depending on who's targeting her, the way I protect her may change.

00:14:34.010 --> 00:14:35.370
Well said.

00:14:35.370 --> 00:14:36.900
Well, isn't that right?

00:14:36.900 --> 00:14:38.230
Is it becoming troublesome?

00:14:38.230 --> 00:14:38.850
No.

00:14:38.850 --> 00:14:39.680
Is it tough?

00:14:40.130 --> 00:14:40.950
Kind of.

00:14:40.950 --> 00:14:41.730
I see.

00:14:43.120 --> 00:14:44.540
Is that all?

00:14:44.540 --> 00:14:47.200
Oh, that's right, I deposited some money for you.

00:14:47.710 --> 00:14:48.840
Really?

00:14:48.840 --> 00:14:51.420
Thank goodness, I was running out of money.

00:14:51.420 --> 00:14:54.260
I deposited some money for an urgent job too.

00:14:54.890 --> 00:14:56.250
What's that?

00:14:56.670 --> 00:14:58.130
Did you not hear?

00:14:58.570 --> 00:15:00.860
I'm in the middle of a job now, though.

00:15:00.860 --> 00:15:01.650
I know.

00:15:02.060 --> 00:15:03.650
I have to protect her, right?

00:15:03.650 --> 00:15:04.940
I'll e-mail you later.

00:15:05.780 --> 00:15:07.430
Do I really have to do the job?

00:15:07.430 --> 00:15:08.560
I'm counting on you.

00:15:11.650 --> 00:15:13.350
Benika-sama, I've confirmed it.

00:15:13.350 --> 00:15:14.570
Good job.

00:15:16.510 --> 00:15:18.720
Please return home with this car.

00:15:19.070 --> 00:15:20.040
And my wife?

00:15:20.040 --> 00:15:23.780
She's out of harm's way and is resting right now.

00:15:23.780 --> 00:15:24.950
I see.

00:15:25.620 --> 00:15:29.360
I will recommend your services to my friends if they require a dispute mediator.

00:15:29.360 --> 00:15:30.660
Thank you very much.

00:15:33.080 --> 00:15:35.910
We'll have to place guards around him soon.

00:15:35.910 --> 00:15:38.600
He's lucky he came to me first.

00:15:38.600 --> 00:15:39.920
Will you also be handling the next one?

00:15:39.920 --> 00:15:41.690
Something of that level? Of course not.

00:15:41.690 --> 00:15:44.100
Will you let the high school student do it, then?

00:15:44.100 --> 00:15:45.350
Are you jealous?

00:15:45.350 --> 00:15:46.680
Yayoi's the jealous one.

00:15:46.680 --> 00:15:47.590
Geez...

00:15:47.590 --> 00:15:49.450
My subordinates are all such a handful.

00:15:49.450 --> 00:15:51.650
You're facing the Kuhouins, after all.

00:15:51.650 --> 00:15:52.650
Did you want to do it?

00:15:53.470 --> 00:15:54.360
Of course not.

00:16:03.010 --> 00:16:04.580
What are you drinking?

00:16:04.580 --> 00:16:05.460
Milk.

00:16:06.260 --> 00:16:06.870
Where'd you get the money?

00:16:07.160 --> 00:16:08.040
Money?

00:16:08.040 --> 00:16:09.150
Did you pay?

00:16:09.150 --> 00:16:10.910
No, she brought it to me.

00:16:11.320 --> 00:16:13.540
It's okay, it's on me.

00:16:13.540 --> 00:16:16.730
Sorry and thank you very much.

00:16:17.210 --> 00:16:18.870
Did you thank her?

00:16:18.870 --> 00:16:20.210
Thank her? Why?

00:16:20.900 --> 00:16:23.290
Not "why," did you not say it?

00:16:23.290 --> 00:16:25.970
Someone always prepared a drink for me when I got out of the bath.

00:16:26.390 --> 00:16:28.700
As I said, this isn't your house.

00:16:28.700 --> 00:16:32.140
Why are you mad? Did I do something wrong?

00:16:32.440 --> 00:16:33.830
You have to say thank you.

00:16:33.830 --> 00:16:34.920
I don't need to.

00:16:34.920 --> 00:16:35.730
You do!

00:16:35.730 --> 00:16:37.430
Isn't this natural for a servant?

00:16:37.430 --> 00:16:38.000
What?

00:16:38.000 --> 00:16:41.610
Is it not natural to have a drink brought to you after getting out of the-

00:16:42.320 --> 00:16:44.780
Did you just hit me?

00:16:44.780 --> 00:16:45.610
Say thank you!

00:16:45.610 --> 00:16:48.060
A servant just brought me milk-

00:16:48.060 --> 00:16:49.200
You hit me again!

00:16:49.480 --> 00:16:51.500
That lady is not your servant.

00:16:51.500 --> 00:16:53.390
Then why did she bring me milk?

00:16:53.390 --> 00:16:54.290
Because she's kind!

00:16:56.080 --> 00:16:59.290
She's being kind to you.

00:16:59.290 --> 00:17:00.550
Why?

00:17:00.910 --> 00:17:04.360
Adults are innately kind to children. There's no real reason.

00:17:05.040 --> 00:17:07.510
So, I was mistaken?

00:17:07.980 --> 00:17:08.840
That's right.

00:17:09.490 --> 00:17:12.740
Do you know what to do when someone is kind to you?

00:17:12.740 --> 00:17:13.730
I do!

00:17:15.990 --> 00:17:17.480
Thank you for taking care of me.

00:17:18.120 --> 00:17:21.980
It was inexcusable of me to thank you this late because of my lack of consideration.

00:17:22.280 --> 00:17:23.540
Forgive me.

00:17:23.900 --> 00:17:24.980
I'm really grateful!

00:17:24.980 --> 00:17:28.330
Not at all, you're welcome.

00:17:28.330 --> 00:17:29.430
Was that okay?

00:17:29.870 --> 00:17:33.580
Perfect, but you just need to say thank you during times like these.

00:17:34.280 --> 00:17:35.090
I got it.

00:17:37.050 --> 00:17:38.610
That futon is thin.

00:17:39.040 --> 00:17:41.900
The futons at your house must've been very plump.

00:17:41.900 --> 00:17:44.050
Your futon really reeks, though.

00:17:44.500 --> 00:17:45.550
Really?

00:17:46.150 --> 00:17:48.290
You should have a futon too.

00:17:48.290 --> 00:17:50.670
It'd be troublesome if you became sick.

00:17:50.670 --> 00:17:51.520
Yeah.

00:17:53.620 --> 00:17:54.450
Does it hurt?

00:17:54.960 --> 00:17:57.320
I guess I hit you too hard earlier.

00:17:57.660 --> 00:17:58.650
Sorry.

00:17:58.650 --> 00:17:59.560
Don't apologize.

00:18:00.490 --> 00:18:02.650
What you said was correct.

00:18:02.650 --> 00:18:04.610
You hit me in order to teach me, right?

00:18:04.980 --> 00:18:06.660
If so, it's unusual for you to apologize.

00:18:07.420 --> 00:18:08.290
Really?

00:18:08.870 --> 00:18:09.790
I guess.

00:18:11.450 --> 00:18:14.140
It hurt earlier, but it wasn't scary.

00:18:14.140 --> 00:18:15.250
It's strange.

00:18:15.890 --> 00:18:18.370
I thought all painful things were scary.

00:18:20.130 --> 00:18:22.820
It's not bad being with you, Shinkurou.

00:18:23.300 --> 00:18:24.530
I'm not sure about that.

00:18:25.110 --> 00:18:27.880
You might be surprised if you saw my true self.

00:18:27.880 --> 00:18:29.840
Were you a fraud all this time?

00:18:30.230 --> 00:18:31.570
That's not what I mean.

00:18:32.320 --> 00:18:34.810
I just mean that people have many faces to them.

00:18:35.320 --> 00:18:36.880
I understand that, then.

00:18:36.880 --> 00:18:38.940
I have many faces too.

00:18:39.650 --> 00:18:40.410
I see.

00:18:42.060 --> 00:18:43.560
It's pure white!

00:18:43.560 --> 00:18:45.480
Now you can sleep properly too, Shinkurou!

00:18:45.720 --> 00:18:46.180
Yeah.

00:18:46.180 --> 00:18:48.630
This one feels a lot better than that hard one!

00:18:48.630 --> 00:18:50.470
That's your futon.

00:18:51.370 --> 00:18:52.030
This one is mine.

00:18:53.340 --> 00:18:55.490
You bought it for me?

00:18:55.490 --> 00:18:56.500
That's right.

00:18:56.800 --> 00:19:00.460
Yay! Now I don't have to worry about the stench!

00:19:00.800 --> 00:19:02.280
I like this one.

00:19:02.810 --> 00:19:04.300
I'm supposed to say thank you at times like these!

00:19:06.470 --> 00:19:10.230
Kurenai Shinkurou, I am thankful for your exceptional regard for me.

00:19:10.570 --> 00:19:12.540
I, Kuhouin Murasaki, hereby...

00:19:12.540 --> 00:19:13.510
Murasaki.

00:19:13.920 --> 00:19:15.300
I told you earlier, didn't I?

00:19:15.300 --> 00:19:16.100
Oh, that's right.

00:19:16.730 --> 00:19:17.640
Thank you!

00:19:30.570 --> 00:19:32.550
That's not what I'm talking about.

00:19:32.550 --> 00:19:34.500
We're just going to remodel a bit.

00:19:34.500 --> 00:19:36.530
That's not the problem here.

00:19:36.900 --> 00:19:38.710
May I leave now?

00:19:38.710 --> 00:19:39.920
Y-Y-Yeah.

00:19:39.920 --> 00:19:41.130
Do you like poker?

00:19:41.130 --> 00:19:42.830
No, I don't know much about it.

00:19:43.590 --> 00:19:44.480
It's simple.

00:19:44.480 --> 00:19:46.340
You can leave now, good job.

00:19:46.690 --> 00:19:49.200
Yes, I-I'll be leaving now, excuse me!

00:19:49.200 --> 00:19:51.340
I'll teach you next time.

00:19:51.730 --> 00:19:53.690
I'm closing down for the day now-

00:19:53.690 --> 00:19:54.790
That's perfect, then.

00:19:54.790 --> 00:19:55.590
As I was saying...

00:19:55.590 --> 00:19:58.770
I'm not here to talk about something so grand as making a casino.

00:19:59.130 --> 00:20:00.630
We're not here just because the wine is good.

00:20:00.630 --> 00:20:02.250
I don't gamble anymore...

00:20:02.250 --> 00:20:03.620
I'm asking because it's you.

00:20:03.620 --> 00:20:05.290
No, things like that...

00:20:05.290 --> 00:20:06.940
So this is how you are now after having a kid?

00:20:07.360 --> 00:20:08.950
That must be tough.

00:20:08.950 --> 00:20:09.790
Why?

00:20:09.790 --> 00:20:11.870
Is your film training coming along?

00:20:11.870 --> 00:20:13.440
That park is too small, isn't it?

00:20:13.440 --> 00:20:14.880
Please let me go!

00:20:14.880 --> 00:20:18.040
Depending on your response, we may have to take care of them.

00:20:18.040 --> 00:20:20.070
Well, I like kids, so it's okay.

00:20:20.070 --> 00:20:22.110
Little boys, Little girls.

00:20:22.420 --> 00:20:23.420
I'm asking you, please stop!

00:20:23.420 --> 00:20:25.210
Either one's fine with me.

00:20:27.330 --> 00:20:29.550
Sorry, we're closed for the day.

00:20:29.880 --> 00:20:31.400
I'm not here to drink wine.

00:20:31.740 --> 00:20:33.870
I'm a dispute mediator.

00:20:35.160 --> 00:20:37.220
You're from Benika's?

00:20:37.220 --> 00:20:38.150
Yes.

00:20:38.150 --> 00:20:40.060
Aren't you just a kid?

00:20:40.060 --> 00:20:43.330
I see, he hired a dispute mediator?

00:20:43.330 --> 00:20:43.850
Yes.

00:20:44.210 --> 00:20:46.150
No wonder he's so persistent.

00:20:46.150 --> 00:20:47.860
It's unfortunate it's only a kid.

00:20:47.860 --> 00:20:49.780
You should stop.

00:20:49.780 --> 00:20:51.530
He's dangerous.

00:20:52.330 --> 00:20:54.830
But, I'm a dispute mediator, after all.

00:20:57.750 --> 00:20:59.530
What, kid?

00:21:00.130 --> 00:21:02.040
I'm sorry, it's my job.

00:21:13.040 --> 00:21:13.760
You bastard!

00:21:34.180 --> 00:21:34.970
No!

00:21:48.480 --> 00:21:50.940
It's okay now.

00:21:50.940 --> 00:21:52.280
You're a monster!

00:21:54.480 --> 00:21:56.130
Are you all right?

00:22:16.120 --> 00:22:18.820
Good night, Murasaki.

00:22:19.930 --> 00:22:21.530
Good night...

00:22:25.240 --> 00:22:27.910
Renjou-sama, Renjou-sama.

00:22:28.290 --> 00:22:31.400
Benika-san is a reliable person, isn't she?

00:22:31.400 --> 00:22:32.420
Me?

00:22:32.420 --> 00:22:35.920
I said so didn't I, Renjou-sama?

